WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.105 --> 00:01.105
MkvDrama.net

3
01:01.665 --> 01:06.385
Taming The Husband

4
01:06.505 --> 01:09.025
Episode 7

5
01:09.825 --> 01:10.905
You're in charge here.

6
01:12.145 --> 01:14.825
Well? How should she be punished?

7
01:22.465 --> 01:23.705
Madam,

8
01:24.505 --> 01:25.905
I've failed to raise my daughter properly.

9
01:27.545 --> 01:28.825
Please punish me.

10
01:30.465 --> 01:32.505
Sneaking into a gambling house was bad enough.

11
01:33.585 --> 01:35.585
Getting an outsider to lie for her

12
01:36.465 --> 01:38.105
and disgrace our family?

13
01:39.545 --> 01:40.745
She deserves a severe punishment.

14
01:43.225 --> 01:45.745
Xie Xi, from this moment,

15
01:46.305 --> 01:47.505
you're confined for three months.

16
01:48.185 --> 01:49.265
Copy Lessons for Women

17
01:49.345 --> 01:50.945
and Xie Family Precepts once each day.

18
01:51.265 --> 01:53.185
No food until you've finished.

19
01:53.785 --> 01:55.105
Dock half a month's-- No.

20
01:55.185 --> 01:56.585
Dock six months of her public allowance.

21
01:58.425 --> 01:59.625
Stay in your room and reflect.

22
02:03.185 --> 02:04.745
Grandmother, Xi normally

23
02:04.825 --> 02:06.225
never sets foot outside the house.

24
02:06.305 --> 02:07.785
If one of our own hadn't gone there,

25
02:07.865 --> 02:09.105
and she hadn't tried to stop them,

26
02:09.225 --> 02:10.905
how would she have ended up there?

27
02:11.465 --> 02:13.505
She was foolish. She deserves punishment.

28
02:13.825 --> 02:15.225
But concern clouded her judgment.

29
02:15.345 --> 02:17.225
She couldn't bear to see you, Grandmother, kept in the dark,

30
02:17.505 --> 02:19.225
or our family disgraced.

31
02:20.225 --> 02:22.385
Shouldn't they be punished, too?

32
02:30.665 --> 02:32.465
But if we expose their wrongdoing,

33
02:33.105 --> 02:34.425
we won't escape punishment ourselves.

34
02:34.585 --> 02:36.665
I was in the wrong first anyway.

35
02:36.745 --> 02:38.065
I'll take the punishment.

36
02:38.145 --> 02:39.745
At least I can take someone down with me!

37
02:39.825 --> 02:41.025
It's not that easy.

38
02:42.265 --> 02:43.705
I won't help you when that happens.

39
02:43.865 --> 02:46.345
Do you really think you can stand up to people that powerful?

40
02:50.305 --> 02:52.305
My brother lost his head over gambling

41
02:52.385 --> 02:54.025
and staked our family home.

42
02:54.505 --> 02:57.225
I was the one who took a valuable to settle his debt.

43
02:57.305 --> 02:59.265
You didn't "take" it. You stole it!

44
02:59.985 --> 03:01.705
Still trying to talk your way out of it?

45
03:02.225 --> 03:04.545
I may be poor and ignorant,

46
03:04.985 --> 03:07.945
but even poor people know shame. We have our pride, too!

47
03:08.425 --> 03:10.305
I was already saving up to buy it back.

48
03:10.585 --> 03:13.105
I was foolish. I didn't know I'd broken the rules.

49
03:14.465 --> 03:15.945
After all those lessons,

50
03:16.345 --> 03:17.745
what have you learned?

51
03:18.225 --> 03:19.705
I've learned this.

52
03:19.865 --> 03:21.425
I may be lowborn,

53
03:21.585 --> 03:24.745
but my heart is no less worthy than yours, however grand your birth!

54
03:25.105 --> 03:27.785
I, Jin Baozhu, answer for what I do. I admit my guilt.

55
03:30.745 --> 03:32.145
But Xie Yan is innocent.

56
03:32.425 --> 03:34.105
I kept it from him when I took...

57
03:34.585 --> 03:35.865
stole that valuable.

58
03:36.345 --> 03:37.665
He only found out later, by chance,

59
03:37.745 --> 03:39.305
and had to recover it.

60
03:39.505 --> 03:41.545
He did nothing wrong. He shouldn't be punished.

61
03:41.905 --> 03:43.905
Besides, the gambling house owner is no fool.

62
03:44.305 --> 03:45.545
He knew my brother

63
03:45.625 --> 03:46.745
hadn't a coin left.

64
03:46.825 --> 03:48.305
Why lend him more money?

65
03:48.425 --> 03:50.185
He stood to lose everything he lent!

66
03:50.505 --> 03:52.745
He knew all about me the moment I arrived.

67
03:52.945 --> 03:54.585
Someone must have told him in advance,

68
03:54.665 --> 03:56.065
had him approach my brother,

69
03:56.145 --> 03:57.265
then find a way

70
03:57.585 --> 03:58.905
to force us to gamble.

71
03:59.265 --> 04:00.385
But who

72
04:01.105 --> 04:02.505
told him all this?

73
04:08.545 --> 04:09.625
Why are you looking at me?

74
04:10.025 --> 04:11.385
Look at whoever lured you to the table.

75
04:12.305 --> 04:14.665
Fine. First,

76
04:15.025 --> 04:16.385
when I went to the Lu estate for my money,

77
04:16.825 --> 04:18.865
I saw Xie Xi sitting beside Lu Ziyu.

78
04:19.105 --> 04:20.825
Second, at the gambling house,

79
04:21.025 --> 04:22.745
I saw them on the second floor, standing together.

80
04:22.825 --> 04:24.785
Third, that Lu Ziyu

81
04:25.025 --> 04:26.385
is a spineless coward.

82
04:26.465 --> 04:27.505
For Xie Xi's sake,

83
04:27.585 --> 04:29.305
terrified as he was, he still testified for her.

84
04:29.425 --> 04:30.905
And he claims he has no ties to the second branch!

85
04:30.985 --> 04:33.865
Who'd believe that? If you didn't know the owner,

86
04:33.945 --> 04:36.145
how did you get the best seats upstairs?

87
04:36.465 --> 04:37.705
The second branch

88
04:38.665 --> 04:39.825
conspired with outsiders

89
04:40.145 --> 04:41.945
to force Xie Yan and me to gamble!

90
04:42.945 --> 04:44.025
I was foolish

91
04:44.105 --> 04:45.185
and fell into your trap.

92
04:45.465 --> 04:47.105
But none of you are innocent!

93
04:47.545 --> 04:49.665
Will you admit your guilt and accept your punishment?

94
04:50.385 --> 04:52.265
Is she telling the truth?

95
04:53.145 --> 04:55.265
No! My mother had nothing to do with it!

96
04:56.305 --> 04:58.425
Xi had a few quarrels with her,

97
04:59.185 --> 05:01.905
and I was angry. So I asked Master Lu to help.

98
05:01.985 --> 05:05.505
Who knew he'd... Who knew he'd act without telling me

99
05:05.625 --> 05:06.985
and come up with such a rotten plan?

100
05:07.065 --> 05:08.225
I only just found out!

101
05:08.305 --> 05:11.065
Grandmother, it was just a quarrel between us children.

102
05:14.465 --> 05:15.985
You'll be punished, too.

103
05:16.505 --> 05:17.745
When you come of age this year,

104
05:18.305 --> 05:19.425
you will not be allowed aboard.

105
05:20.065 --> 05:22.145
Reflect on your conduct for three months.

106
05:22.625 --> 05:23.825
Do this again,

107
05:23.905 --> 05:25.025
and there will be no mercy.

108
05:25.465 --> 05:26.705
Yes.

109
05:26.985 --> 05:30.585
And you. Punish or reprimand them as appropriate.

110
05:30.825 --> 05:31.905
When you're done,

111
05:31.985 --> 05:33.185
report to me.

112
05:33.625 --> 05:34.665
Yes, Mother.

113
05:46.665 --> 05:49.705
They were all born with silver spoons in their mouths.

114
05:50.265 --> 05:52.225
Someone picks them up when they fall.

115
05:52.505 --> 05:53.585
And you?

116
05:54.065 --> 05:55.545
One false step,

117
05:56.065 --> 05:59.025
and it's all downhill from there.

118
06:13.225 --> 06:16.065
The Xie ancestral hall

119
06:22.225 --> 06:25.585
Jin Baozhu, you stole valuables from this house,

120
06:25.745 --> 06:27.225
led your husband into gambling,

121
06:27.665 --> 06:29.065
and deceived everyone.

122
06:29.625 --> 06:30.665
That compounds your guilt.

123
06:31.345 --> 06:33.865
Twenty strokes of the cane, then you're to be sold off.

124
06:34.225 --> 06:35.265
Begin!

125
06:40.665 --> 06:43.305
I won't kneel. I'll take my punishment standing.

126
06:44.745 --> 06:46.025
Defying the lady of the house?

127
06:46.385 --> 06:47.545
Another offense!

128
06:47.745 --> 06:48.905
Beat her again!

129
06:54.385 --> 06:55.425
Stop!

130
06:57.705 --> 07:00.265
Honor our ancestors' blessings

131
07:32.505 --> 07:34.345
Lady Qin is only in charge temporarily.

132
07:35.345 --> 07:36.745
She's not the lady of the house!

133
07:37.745 --> 07:39.025
She didn't steal it.

134
07:39.545 --> 07:41.745
She borrowed it to save her family. And it's been returned intact.

135
07:42.185 --> 07:43.745
Nor did she make me gamble.

136
07:44.225 --> 07:45.345
I chose to do it.

137
07:45.785 --> 07:46.785
Under the household rules,

138
07:47.585 --> 07:49.105
she merits a few dozen lashes at most.

139
07:50.065 --> 07:51.345
Why go this far?

140
07:51.425 --> 07:52.585
Her name is Jin,

141
07:53.465 --> 07:54.505
not Xie.

142
07:55.665 --> 07:59.745
The household rules apply to family members.

143
08:00.265 --> 08:02.785
She's a common thief, an outsider!

144
08:04.225 --> 08:05.305
My husband, Xie Yan,

145
08:05.505 --> 08:07.265
is Yangzhou's renowned scholar!

146
08:07.345 --> 08:08.785
Who are you to insult him?

147
08:09.145 --> 08:10.225
Begin the caning!

148
08:10.705 --> 08:11.785
Get lost!

149
08:12.985 --> 08:15.105
Jin Baozhu is my lawful bride.

150
08:15.185 --> 08:16.945
She's on my household register. She belongs with me.

151
08:17.545 --> 08:19.225
Her misconduct is my responsibility.

152
08:19.545 --> 08:20.585
Lady Qin, if someone must be punished,

153
08:21.505 --> 08:22.745
punish me.

154
08:24.345 --> 08:25.385
Xie Yan!

155
08:25.545 --> 08:26.705
Yan, have you lost your mind?

156
08:29.065 --> 08:30.705
The Xies have already ruined my legs.

157
08:34.745 --> 08:36.305
What's one more beating?

158
08:37.905 --> 08:39.665
Mind your words, my lord.

159
08:40.945 --> 08:43.065
Everyone in this household knows

160
08:43.825 --> 08:46.425
how your father dotes on you.

161
08:46.985 --> 08:48.345
And who am I?

162
08:48.465 --> 08:50.345
I'm only a lowly concubine.

163
08:50.425 --> 08:52.025
If anyone asks, Lady Qin,

164
08:52.505 --> 08:53.705
just tell them the truth.

165
08:56.705 --> 08:58.465
Will that satisfy you?

166
08:59.025 --> 09:00.105
It will.

167
09:01.745 --> 09:03.265
As long as you're satisfied.

168
09:04.705 --> 09:06.905
Someone! Take her away!

169
09:06.985 --> 09:09.545
No! No!

170
09:10.625 --> 09:11.665
-Move! -No!

171
09:12.345 --> 09:13.385
Xie Yan!

172
09:13.905 --> 09:14.905
Come here.

173
09:14.985 --> 09:16.785
Xie Yan! Xie Yan!

174
09:19.825 --> 09:20.905
Begin the caning!

175
09:21.465 --> 09:22.745
Xie Yan!

176
09:25.385 --> 09:26.665
Xie Yan!

177
09:27.865 --> 09:29.145
My brother's taking your beating.

178
09:29.225 --> 09:31.385
If you won't see sense and let his suffering be in vain,

179
09:31.465 --> 09:32.825
I'll kill you!

180
09:59.545 --> 10:02.905
Xie Yan, if it hurts,

181
10:03.785 --> 10:04.905
hold my hand.

182
10:06.585 --> 10:07.625
Mind your own business.

183
10:07.705 --> 10:08.785
Go.

184
10:50.665 --> 10:51.745
Mother.

185
10:53.225 --> 10:54.345
You're back.

186
10:54.505 --> 10:56.825
-Tired after today? -No.

187
10:57.145 --> 10:58.465
What did your father say this time?

188
10:58.545 --> 10:59.945
He kept you so late.

189
11:01.505 --> 11:03.665
This year, he's pushed himself too hard traveling with Uncle Chengzong.

190
11:03.745 --> 11:05.105
his health is suffering.

191
11:05.425 --> 11:07.145
He wants a longer rest before leaving.

192
11:08.385 --> 11:10.185
Here. Have some water.

193
11:11.025 --> 11:13.105
This is the private allowance I saved while I was away this year.

194
11:13.625 --> 11:16.065
Keep it safe, and don't tell anyone.

195
11:16.305 --> 11:17.345
Keep it for yourself.

196
11:17.425 --> 11:20.305
Take it, Mother. Think of it as my board for a while.

197
11:21.425 --> 11:23.665
You dear child. All right.

198
11:31.305 --> 11:34.385
He also brought up marriage.

199
11:38.905 --> 11:40.745
Even Yan is married now.

200
11:41.505 --> 11:42.745
If you don't marry soon,

201
11:43.425 --> 11:45.185
it'll be hard to explain.

202
11:47.545 --> 11:50.865
He said he hoped I'd find a good family,

203
11:51.505 --> 11:53.025
preferably in the same trade,

204
11:53.505 --> 11:55.025
so we could help each other.

205
11:56.265 --> 11:57.385
What did you say?

206
11:59.305 --> 12:02.225
I said I'm away so much,

207
12:02.705 --> 12:04.745
I'd only let down a girl from a good family.

208
12:06.025 --> 12:07.305
I talked around it for a while,

209
12:07.825 --> 12:09.505
and put him off for this year.

210
12:15.705 --> 12:16.865
But I feel bad for you, Mother,

211
12:17.945 --> 12:19.745
with no one here to keep you company.

212
12:22.945 --> 12:24.105
Silly child.

213
12:24.465 --> 12:26.345
I'm quite happy on my own.

214
12:35.465 --> 12:39.785
You forget everything at the sight of money.

215
12:40.385 --> 12:42.705
You think I'm a miser like you?

216
12:42.985 --> 12:45.825
I'm laughing because I saw quite a show today.

217
12:46.225 --> 12:48.385
That new concubine is a delight!

218
12:48.465 --> 12:49.745
Barking at everyone.

219
12:50.185 --> 12:51.265
She nearly tore Qin Kehan

220
12:51.345 --> 12:52.905
to pieces!

221
12:53.225 --> 12:54.785
I couldn't say this earlier,

222
12:55.065 --> 12:57.425
but when they were arguing, why did you have to stir things up?

223
12:57.945 --> 13:00.345
Mother hates these struggles for power.

224
13:00.425 --> 13:02.225
You need to be careful.

225
13:02.305 --> 13:04.425
Wasn't it your brother who started it?

226
13:04.785 --> 13:07.025
When he went to serve at court,

227
13:07.625 --> 13:09.585
he left us to hold things together.

228
13:09.665 --> 13:12.145
And then? His son got into trouble,

229
13:12.425 --> 13:14.345
he lost his post,

230
13:14.465 --> 13:15.985
and came slinking home.

231
13:16.625 --> 13:18.225
Now he wants to run the household again.

232
13:18.425 --> 13:19.465
Where does that leave us?

233
13:19.825 --> 13:21.145
What are you so angry about?

234
13:21.225 --> 13:22.785
I may be his half-brother, born to a concubine,

235
13:22.865 --> 13:24.385
but I have the skill and experience.

236
13:24.465 --> 13:26.185
I'm his right-hand man.

237
13:26.385 --> 13:28.305
He can't manage without me out there.

238
13:28.745 --> 13:30.065
Even here at home,

239
13:30.185 --> 13:32.745
I'm the one Mother favors more.

240
13:32.825 --> 13:33.905
You'd better be right.

241
13:34.225 --> 13:35.425
Don't worry so much.

242
13:36.625 --> 13:38.425
Mother said so herself.

243
13:38.785 --> 13:40.265
She thought Heng's gift

244
13:40.345 --> 13:41.665
was better than his.

245
13:42.065 --> 13:43.145
She even called Heng

246
13:43.265 --> 13:44.865
the best of the lot!

247
13:52.025 --> 13:53.825
That reminds me of something funny.

248
13:54.105 --> 13:55.185
What?

249
13:55.825 --> 13:58.185
These past few days, I've had the side gate guards

250
13:58.265 --> 13:59.425
pick garden balsam for me.

251
13:59.825 --> 14:02.225
When Lady Jin sneaked out,

252
14:02.345 --> 14:04.105
it was partly thanks to me!

253
14:04.825 --> 14:05.865
It's hilarious!

254
14:06.265 --> 14:07.625
You were lucky.

255
14:07.705 --> 14:09.545
She didn't drag you into it.

256
14:10.105 --> 14:11.945
You know what would have happened.

257
14:17.505 --> 14:18.945
What are you daydreaming about?

258
14:21.345 --> 14:23.185
Enough. Let me.

259
14:23.265 --> 14:24.385
Yes.

260
14:25.985 --> 14:27.065
Honestly!

261
14:28.225 --> 14:29.385
His mind's been

262
14:29.785 --> 14:32.465
elsewhere lately.

263
14:32.865 --> 14:34.545
Without a letter of recommendation,

264
14:34.625 --> 14:36.465
he can't go to the capital for the medical officer exam.

265
14:36.665 --> 14:39.185
He's worried sick. Aren't you?

266
14:39.425 --> 14:40.505
Yes.

267
14:54.705 --> 14:56.505
Jianwei, why does he have

268
14:56.585 --> 14:57.585
so many old wounds?

269
15:02.225 --> 15:04.185
Jin Baozhu! Jin Baozhu!

270
15:10.025 --> 15:11.065
Get out here!

271
15:12.265 --> 15:13.345
You--

272
15:13.425 --> 15:14.465
Get out!

273
15:14.625 --> 15:16.505
I'm not leaving. We have an agreement.

274
15:16.665 --> 15:18.825
You got him punished, and you still have the nerve to stay?

275
15:18.945 --> 15:20.745
When he wakes, he may not want to see you.

276
15:20.945 --> 15:23.105
This house is far too humble for someone as grand as you.

277
15:23.305 --> 15:24.585
Ask to be released and leave.

278
15:24.905 --> 15:25.985
Get out!

279
15:28.305 --> 15:29.385
Get out!

280
15:31.025 --> 15:32.185
Then take good care of him.

281
15:32.505 --> 15:34.425
I'll be just outside. Call if you need me.

282
15:35.105 --> 15:37.865
Go. Go.

283
16:02.865 --> 16:04.425
Why don't we have New Year couplets

284
16:04.505 --> 16:05.545
and lanterns in our courtyard?

285
16:07.905 --> 16:09.425
I had everything prepared.

286
16:09.745 --> 16:10.825
I'm just waiting for you to come home.

287
16:11.705 --> 16:13.185
You're so clever.

288
16:14.825 --> 16:16.225
Can you tell me

289
16:17.705 --> 16:19.505
where I should go?

290
16:20.185 --> 16:21.425
It's not that easy.

291
16:22.185 --> 16:23.625
I won't help you when that happens.

292
16:29.825 --> 16:31.265
You're so clever.

293
16:33.425 --> 16:35.065
Can you tell me

294
16:37.305 --> 16:38.545
why you...

295
17:06.465 --> 17:07.585
What are you doing here?

296
17:08.785 --> 17:09.985
I've repaid my debt to you,

297
17:11.265 --> 17:12.665
but I still owe Young Master Xie.

298
17:13.505 --> 17:15.385
This is an ointment I made myself.

299
17:15.545 --> 17:17.425
It works faster. Take it.

300
17:24.145 --> 17:25.745
I take Madam's pulse,

301
17:26.545 --> 17:28.785
and whenever a servant falls ill, they come to me.

302
17:29.385 --> 17:30.665
You saw that for yourself.

303
17:31.785 --> 17:32.865
Take it.

304
17:46.825 --> 17:48.505
You've been busy all this time.

305
17:49.145 --> 17:50.305
I thought you might not have eaten.

306
17:50.785 --> 17:53.225
The kitchen leftovers were all taken by the servants.

307
17:53.305 --> 17:56.265
There's nothing left. This was all I could find.

308
17:58.625 --> 17:59.665
What are these?

309
18:00.745 --> 18:03.745
Grapes. I once read

310
18:04.105 --> 18:05.625
that somewhere in the West,

311
18:05.705 --> 18:08.185
at New Year, people eat grapes as the clock chimes.

312
18:08.265 --> 18:09.625
The more grapes you eat,

313
18:09.985 --> 18:11.425
the luckier you'll be next year.

314
18:14.305 --> 18:15.385
Thank you.

315
18:17.305 --> 18:19.505
But he doesn't want to see me.

316
18:19.585 --> 18:22.025
Could you take this in to him for me?

317
18:30.505 --> 18:31.705
What's a chiming clock?

318
18:31.905 --> 18:33.145
Something like a water clock, I suppose.

319
18:34.585 --> 18:36.145
There's a Western clock here.

320
18:36.225 --> 18:37.945
It chimes at midnight.

321
18:38.705 --> 18:39.825
Unfortunately,

322
18:39.905 --> 18:41.305
it's past midnight now.

323
18:42.345 --> 18:44.985
Another day. I'll take you to hear it another day.

324
19:58.505 --> 19:59.585
What's wrong?

325
20:00.865 --> 20:03.665
I... I didn't know grapes had seeds.

326
20:07.105 --> 20:09.105
While he was still asleep,

327
20:09.185 --> 20:10.265
I took his pulse.

328
20:11.305 --> 20:12.385
There's hope for his legs.

329
20:18.785 --> 20:19.865
What?

330
20:20.345 --> 20:23.105
Xie Yan's legs can recover.

331
20:37.385 --> 20:38.425
He's awake.

332
20:42.345 --> 20:43.345
Where am I?

333
20:44.825 --> 20:47.305
The morning air's fresh out here.

334
20:47.585 --> 20:49.185
Better than that stuffy room.

335
20:49.465 --> 20:51.705
So I had them bring you out for some air.

336
20:54.105 --> 20:55.185
Where's Jin Baozhu?

337
20:57.065 --> 20:58.425
I've been here since early morning,

338
20:58.505 --> 20:59.545
but I haven't seen her.

339
20:59.625 --> 21:00.745
Lie back down.

340
21:00.985 --> 21:03.825
Be good. Here.

341
21:05.025 --> 21:06.065
Careful.

342
21:10.425 --> 21:11.625
Still hurts?

343
21:16.545 --> 21:17.585
As for the second branch,

344
21:18.545 --> 21:19.785
Yi told me what happened.

345
21:20.745 --> 21:22.985
Don't worry. Your mother's here.

346
21:23.865 --> 21:25.065
I'll see that you're treated fairly.

347
21:32.385 --> 21:33.465
Yan.

348
21:37.865 --> 21:38.945
Don't come any closer.

349
21:47.345 --> 21:49.025
I know the sight of me upsets you.

350
21:49.745 --> 21:51.385
You won't even tell me when you're hurt.

351
21:53.305 --> 21:55.985
Can't I look at you from a distance, at least?

352
21:56.505 --> 21:57.865
I'd rather you didn't look at all.

353
22:10.225 --> 22:11.585
I asked him to come.

354
22:27.705 --> 22:29.545
Why is Yan the one who's hurt?

355
22:30.025 --> 22:31.905
Shouldn't that Jin woman be punished?

356
22:32.225 --> 22:33.465
Have her brought here at once!

357
22:35.065 --> 22:36.425
If you really care about him,

358
22:36.665 --> 22:38.025
get your facts straight first,

359
22:38.105 --> 22:39.385
then do something useful.

360
22:40.305 --> 22:43.665
Then I'll find some good doctors.

361
22:44.185 --> 22:47.625
There's no need. I can treat these surface wounds.

362
22:48.145 --> 22:49.545
Do what you should be doing.

363
22:50.105 --> 22:51.305
Must you make me

364
22:51.385 --> 22:52.545
play the villain?

365
22:53.545 --> 22:55.705
Kehan was only being fair.

366
22:56.065 --> 22:57.865
You've already failed Hanzhang.

367
22:59.425 --> 23:01.425
Don't fail her child as well.

368
23:12.785 --> 23:14.785
Have you taken the medicines?

369
23:15.025 --> 23:16.185
Any you liked?

370
23:16.905 --> 23:18.585
I'll bring some more next time.

371
23:23.265 --> 23:24.345
I don't remember.

372
23:24.865 --> 23:28.505
My illness comes from years of pent-up sorrow.

373
23:28.865 --> 23:30.185
It's left me weak,

374
23:30.625 --> 23:31.985
and medicine can't cure the cause.

375
23:33.425 --> 23:35.985
Better to save that money

376
23:36.145 --> 23:38.305
and add to Yan's private allowance.

377
23:47.225 --> 23:48.745
He's resting now.

378
23:49.105 --> 23:50.505
You should go, too.

379
23:59.665 --> 24:02.025
Fetch some medicine from Master Song.

380
24:03.505 --> 24:04.505
Will you remember?

381
24:04.585 --> 24:05.665
Yes.

382
24:17.545 --> 24:20.465
Where's that little terror? What trouble is she stirring up now?

383
24:22.105 --> 24:23.825
Yi wouldn't let her in last night,

384
24:23.905 --> 24:25.385
so she waited at the door all night.

385
24:25.665 --> 24:26.905
I don't know if she's gone back.

386
24:27.585 --> 24:28.865
Is she in her room?

387
24:29.345 --> 24:30.865
I just checked.

388
24:31.145 --> 24:32.465
Lady Jin isn't there.

389
24:33.785 --> 24:34.985
That little fool.

390
24:35.985 --> 24:37.745
Still making me worry at a time like this!

391
24:42.145 --> 24:44.905
Last night, what did Xie Yi say to her?

392
24:50.865 --> 24:51.945
Tell me.

393
24:58.065 --> 24:59.265
Jin Baozhu! Jin Baozhu!

394
24:59.345 --> 25:00.505
Get out here!

395
25:00.705 --> 25:02.705
I have to look after him. We have an agreement.

396
25:02.905 --> 25:05.185
You got him punished, and you still have the nerve to stay?

397
25:05.745 --> 25:07.505
He has people to look after him.

398
25:08.065 --> 25:10.225
This house is far too humble for someone as grand as you.

399
25:10.305 --> 25:11.945
Ask to be released and leave.

400
25:16.065 --> 25:17.065
This is bad.

401
25:19.825 --> 25:20.985
Stubborn fool.

402
25:22.145 --> 25:23.665
Now she decides to do as she's told!

403
25:30.945 --> 25:33.265
What are you standing there for? Help me find her, quickly!

404
25:38.105 --> 25:39.185
I'm a fool, too.

405
25:40.745 --> 25:42.145
She barely knows any characters.

406
25:42.785 --> 25:44.265
How could she write a petition for release?

407
25:56.945 --> 25:58.065
Jianwei,

408
26:02.265 --> 26:03.305
let it go.

409
26:06.865 --> 26:09.465
My lord, but it's your favorite bird.

410
26:12.625 --> 26:13.745
I don't want it anymore.

411
26:16.425 --> 26:17.545
Yes.

412
26:38.505 --> 26:41.785
I'm tired. Take me back to rest.

413
26:43.105 --> 26:44.145
Yes.

414
27:26.745 --> 27:28.025
Now you know.

415
27:29.305 --> 27:30.865
This house is a lion's den.

416
27:31.785 --> 27:32.785
Why come back?

417
27:35.305 --> 27:36.625
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

418
27:38.625 --> 27:40.305
I know you don't want to see me.

419
27:41.865 --> 27:43.425
I'm just glad you're all right.

420
27:43.505 --> 27:44.545
I'll go.

421
27:53.745 --> 27:54.865
I'm not all right!

422
27:55.305 --> 27:56.945
What makes you think there's nothing wrong with me?

423
28:02.785 --> 28:03.865
You can still bicker.

424
28:04.185 --> 28:05.585
You seem fine to me.

425
28:37.305 --> 28:40.425
Didn't you leave? Why come back?

426
28:42.385 --> 28:43.985
I broke valuables in this house,

427
28:44.105 --> 28:45.705
worth 1,998 taels.

428
28:45.785 --> 28:46.865
Since I have no money to pay,

429
28:46.945 --> 28:48.505
I'll stay in the Xie estate to serve you,

430
28:48.585 --> 28:49.585
at your beck and call.

431
28:50.065 --> 28:52.065
Laundry, cleaning, serving tea and water.

432
28:52.665 --> 28:54.345
I'll do all the rough and heavy work.

433
28:54.585 --> 28:56.305
You'll obey every order in this house.

434
28:56.465 --> 28:58.225
You'll work off your debt.

435
28:58.305 --> 29:00.825
After three years, you'll owe nothing, and you'll be free.

436
29:02.665 --> 29:04.185
You're a fast learner.

437
29:05.665 --> 29:09.425
Is this what they mean by "A dying man's words are kind"?

438
29:10.465 --> 29:11.865
Can't you say one decent thing?

439
29:12.785 --> 29:14.025
I taught you perfectly good sayings,

440
29:14.105 --> 29:15.105
and you talk such nonsense!

441
29:25.545 --> 29:26.625
What are you doing?

442
29:27.265 --> 29:28.505
I'll put the medicine on.

443
29:29.025 --> 29:31.185
I'll put it on your legs. Give you a massage.

444
29:32.145 --> 29:33.745
The meridians in his legs are severely blocked.

445
29:34.025 --> 29:36.025
Pain-relieving powder alone treats the symptoms, not the cause.

446
29:36.825 --> 29:38.065
He needs daily therapeutic massage

447
29:38.145 --> 29:39.145
to improve circulation and clear the blockages.

448
29:39.225 --> 29:40.345
Only then can he improve.

449
29:42.145 --> 29:46.305
Look. First, put the medicine in your palm.

450
29:46.505 --> 29:47.705
Rub your hands until they're warm.

451
29:48.025 --> 29:49.385
Then put your hands on either side of the legs.

452
29:49.985 --> 29:51.345
Press the acupuncture points

453
29:51.905 --> 29:53.505
to work the medicine in.

454
29:53.705 --> 29:55.305
Start gently, then increase the pressure,

455
29:55.385 --> 29:56.425
a little at a time.

456
29:56.705 --> 29:58.545
Remember, don't press too hard.

457
30:03.025 --> 30:05.505
Relax your palm.

458
30:08.145 --> 30:09.145
Relax your wrist.

459
30:10.225 --> 30:11.785
Follow the meridians.

460
30:15.705 --> 30:16.945
No, that's not right.

461
30:17.025 --> 30:19.905
Doing this on your own legs is awkward, isn't it?

462
30:20.065 --> 30:23.465
How about this? Find someone suitable to practice on.

463
30:23.985 --> 30:25.185
I'll take you through it slowly.

464
30:27.705 --> 30:28.785
Surely you've repaid

465
30:28.865 --> 30:30.025
what you owe us?

466
30:30.105 --> 30:32.345
Why go to all that trouble when there's nothing in it for you?

467
30:34.945 --> 30:36.465
Because I need something from you both.

468
30:41.385 --> 30:42.505
Who taught you that?

469
30:43.065 --> 30:45.665
The... one I bought the extra meat for.

470
30:45.745 --> 30:46.865
You really bought him extra meat?

471
30:47.065 --> 30:49.065
I got you two extra scoops!

472
30:57.425 --> 31:01.025
Go. So many doctors have already examined me.

473
31:01.905 --> 31:03.265
My legs have long been beyond saving.

474
31:03.505 --> 31:04.865
How do you know unless you try?

475
31:07.785 --> 31:09.145
Jin Baozhu,

476
31:09.705 --> 31:11.185
if your mother promised

477
31:11.585 --> 31:12.985
that if you worked hard,

478
31:13.265 --> 31:14.665
she'd give you an egg,

479
31:15.265 --> 31:16.985
but though you worked hard every day,

480
31:17.145 --> 31:19.225
she never gave you one,

481
31:20.305 --> 31:21.705
how would you feel?

482
31:25.585 --> 31:26.945
I'd be hurt.

483
31:30.865 --> 31:32.265
So many people

484
31:33.385 --> 31:34.785
have promised me eggs.

485
31:37.505 --> 31:39.585
Now I don't want to get my hopes up for nothing again.

486
31:43.025 --> 31:44.265
Trying doesn't guarantee you an egg,

487
31:44.425 --> 31:46.545
but not trying guarantees you none. Right?

488
31:53.385 --> 31:54.385
Your leg...

489
31:54.465 --> 31:56.825
Get out. Get out!

490
32:00.025 --> 32:01.065
Why?

491
32:01.065 --> 32:02.065
MkvDrama.net
